---
title: Branch Strategy & Deployment Flow
---
flowchart LR
    subgraph Development
        F1[feature/inventory]
        F2[feature/payments]
        F3[bug/calc-error]
    end

    subgraph "PR Gate"
        PR_TEST[Integration Test<br/>Compile + Provision + Deploy<br/>+ Test + Teardown]
    end

    subgraph Integration
        MAIN[main<br/>Build only - no deploy<br/>All code validated via PR]
    end

    subgraph Release
        REL[release/sprint-12]
    end

    subgraph Environments
        UAT[UAT]
        DM[DM]
        GOLD[GOLD]
        PROD[PROD]
    end

    F1 -->|PR| PR_TEST
    F2 -->|PR| PR_TEST
    F3 -->|PR| PR_TEST
    PR_TEST -->|pass| MAIN
    MAIN -->|sprint end: cut branch| REL
    REL -->|deploy.yml| UAT
    UAT -->|succeeded| DM
    DM -->|release.yml| GOLD
    GOLD -->|approval| PROD

    style PR_TEST fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#2196f3
    style MAIN fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4caf50
    style REL fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#2196f3
    style UAT fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
    style DM fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
    style GOLD fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style PROD fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
